"Pipeline heeft een <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/"
"pipeline\">website</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt Pipeline verkrijgen via <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"We gebruiken <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> als "
"videospeler."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"We gebruiken <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</"
"a> en <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> om gegevens van YouTube te "
"verkrijgen."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"De maker van Pipeline heeft ook andere applicaties ontwikkeld, zoals <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> en <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
#| msgid ""
#| "The more public Piped instances there are, the faster Pipeline will be "
#| "able to fetch your subscriptions from Piped. So consider <a "
#| "href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> "
#| "and making it available for everyone."
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Hoe meer openbare Piped-instanties er zijn, hoe sneller Pipeline uw "
"abonnementen van Piped kan ophalen. Overweeg daarom om <a href=\"https://"
"docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">Piped zelf te hosten</a> en voor "
"iedereen beschikbaar te maken."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Er zijn geen dieren kwaad aangedaan bij het maken van deze applicatie. Er "
"zijn wel twee katten geaaid."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Voeg video's toe aan je 'later bekijken' lijst door het contextmenu te "
"openen of direct tijdens het afspelen van video's."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Zie je iets wat je niet leuk vindt? Je kunt video's in je feed verbergen op "
"basis van de titel en de uploader van de video."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt video's die je al hebt bekeken verbergen. Schakel deze functie in "
"via je filters."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr ""
"Je kunt filters in de feed snel in- en uitschakelen via het "
"filterdialoogvenster."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Wil je jouw abonnementen van YouTube of NewPipe behouden? Je kunt ze "
"importeren in Pipeline."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Wil je liever je eigen videospeler gebruiken in plaats van de ingebouwde? Je "
"kunt een externe videospeler beheren in de instellingen en Pipeline laten "
"weten dat deze standaard moet worden gebruikt."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Wil je een video die je hebt bekeken bewaren? Je kunt hem direct downloaden "
"van de videopagina."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Wil je een video delen? Je kunt de URL direct vanaf de videopagina naar het "
"klembord kopiëren."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Beheer je jouw eigen Piped instantie? Je kunt Pipeline in de instellingen "
"laten weten dat je die wilt gebruiken."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr ""
"Geen interesse in die pop-up teksten? Je kunt ze uitschakelen in de "
"instellingen."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vind je YouTube niet meer leuk? Pipeline werkt ook met <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Ben je op zoek naar iets? Pipeline kan je daarbij helpen en zoekt naar "
"kanalen en video's op YouTube en Peertube."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""

